{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>משא.</b> בליל, construct state, and the sense is בליל כך from the oath." "<b>שודד ער מואב.</b> And behold, it lacks a bet in מואב." "<b>נדמה.</b> Cut off, like ודמיתי אמך (Hosea 4:5)." "<b>קיר מואב.</b> A province, like וארם מקיר (Amos 9:7)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:52.745946059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}